    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "AN OUTSTANDING ADDRESS - PRESENTING THIS SUPERB FOUR-BEDROOM DETACHED FAMILY HOME, LESS THAN 10 MINUTES FROM LONGFORD TOWN.\r\n\r\nIt gives us great pleasure here at Davis Auctioneers to bring to the market, this fine four-bedroom, detached property, just a few minutes’ drive from the N4 and Longford Town. \r\n\r\nThis attractive property is superbly located with Newtownfobes, Drumlish, Ballinalee, Killoe & Longford Town just a few minutes drive away. The quaint village of Cullyfad, is within walking distance - Coill Fada meaning the long wood, is a quiet rural village consisting of Community Centre, Church and sports field. \r\n\r\nThe well-appointed accommodation consists of a light filled entrance hall, kitchen/dining room, sitting room, living room, utility room and wc on the ground floor. There are four large bedrooms in total, master en-suite, and a large family bathroom on the first floor.\r\n\r\nThis property, together with its large south facing garden, tarmacadam driveway, stone facade and piers, as well as many more outstanding features, is expected to generate huge interest. If you are considering the perfect family home, remote working being a priority, or just simply seeking a superb home in the heart of Longford, this one is well worth a visit.\r\n\r\nViewing of this beautiful home is highly recommended by the sole Auctioneers.\r\n\r\nPlease call to us at 53 Main Street, Longford or contact us on 043 3350555 to book your viewing.\r\n\r\nEIRCODE: N39 DP11\r\n\r\nFOLIO NO. LD7692F\r\n\r\nBER CERT B"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Sitting room: 4.15m x 3.45m\r\n\r\nLiving room/dining room: 3.45m x 4.15m\r\n\r\nKitchen: 3.05m x 5.50m \r\n\r\nUtility & WC: 3.45m x 3.10m\r\n\r\nBed 1: 3.20m x 3.45m\r\nEn suite: 0.9m x 2.55m\r\n\r\nBed 2: 3.45m x 3.65m\r\n\r\nBed 3: 3.50m x 3.55m\r\n\r\nBed 4: 2.95m x 3.01m\r\n\r\nBathroom: 1.90m x 2.35m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "South Facing Rear Garden\r\n\r\nKilloe National School 5-minute drive\r\n\r\n5km from Abbott Diagnostics Ireland (Longford’s largest employer)\r\n\r\nLocated just 5km off the N4\r\n\r\n10 minutes to Longford Town Centre\r\n\r\nBeautiful stone façade and entrance piers\r\n\r\nTarmac driveway providing vehicle access to the rear\r\n\r\nTimber rail boundary fencing\r\n\r\nGarden shed\r\n\r\nTreatment system controls station located in the shed\r\n\r\nOil Fired Central Heating\r\n\r\nHugely sought-after area with excellent National & secondary Schools close by\r\n\r\nNewtownfobes, Drumlish, Ballinalee, Killoe & Longford Town just a few minutes drive\r\n\r\nExcellent Broadband\r\n\r\nBus service to Secondary Schools in Longford \r\n\r\nLongford Train Station: 10-15 Minute drive\r\n\r\n7 Trains a day on the Dublin-Sligo Line\r\n\r\nCommute to Dublin- 1 hour & 20 mins\r\n\r\nDouble Glazed Pvc Windows and Doors\r\n\r\nLarge kitchen-dining area\r\n\r\nUtility area with fitted units \r\n\r\nStove in the sitting room \r\n\r\nMains water and treatment tank system"
      },
      {
